WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:03.539
Toad dressed for the party.

2
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.644
He listened to the voices downstairs.

3
00:00:07.645 --> 00:00:11.883
"Ah, the guests are here," he said.

4
00:00:11.884 --> 00:00:14.859
Toad sat on his bed.

5
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.951
"It's a shame they won't let me sing," he said.

6
00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.488
"No one will hear my song."

7
00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:24.297
Then he smiled.

8
00:00:24.298 --> 00:00:30.219
"But I [i@will@i] sing my song!" he cried.

9
00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:34.167
Toad set some chairs in a row.

10
00:00:34.168 --> 00:00:36.993
Then he stood on his bed.

11
00:00:36.994 --> 00:00:40.999
He faced the empty seats and bowed.

12
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.955
He sang at the top of his voice:

13
00:00:44.956 --> 00:00:47.090
[i@Fear was in the hall,@i]

14
00:00:47.091 --> 00:00:49.231
[i@And fighting in the yard,@i]

15
00:00:49.232 --> 00:00:51.392
[i@The enemy cried, "I give up!"@i]

16
00:00:51.393 --> 00:00:53.760
[i@When Toad came home!@i]

17
00:00:53.761 --> 00:00:55.898
[i@Every window smashed,@i]

18
00:00:55.899 --> 00:00:57.780
[i@Every dish went@i] crash!

19
00:00:57.781 --> 00:01:01.933
[i@The ferrets ran away and hid,@i]

20
00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:05.164
[i@When Toad came home!@i]

21
00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:07.448
[i@Then Toad struck the mighty blow,@i]

22
00:01:07.449 --> 00:01:09.587
[i@The Wild-Wooders had to go,@i]

23
00:01:09.588 --> 00:01:11.686
[i@When Toad came home!@i]

24
00:01:11.687 --> 00:01:14.003
[i@The hero's in his hall!@i]

25
00:01:14.004 --> 00:01:16.171
[i@Everyone can smile,@i]

26
00:01:16.172 --> 00:01:21.176
[i@Bang the drum and shout, "Hooray!"@i]

27
00:01:21.177 --> 00:01:28.933
[i@Because Toad came home!@i]

28
00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:33.590
When Toad was done, he sang it again.

29
00:01:33.591 --> 00:01:37.939
Then he sighed a deep sigh.

30
00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:41.817
He brushed his hair and buttoned his coat.

31
00:01:41.818 --> 00:01:47.299
He quietly went downstairs.

